# | 2 | `b00t datums graph` CLI subcommand | ch0nky | `b00t-cli/src/commands/datum.rs` |
# | 3 | Mermaid serializer for OntologyGraph | sm0l | `b00t-cli/src/datums/graph_render.rs` |
# | 4 | PlantUML serializer (pipe to plantuml MCP) | sm0l | `b00t-cli/src/datums/plantuml.rs` |
# | 5 | Test: extract 30+ datums → assert node count ≥ 30 | sm0l | `tests/datum_graph.rs` |
# | 6 | Optional: rotel-visual input source for tomllm | ch0nky | `vendor/l3dg3rr/crates/rotel-visual/src/sources/tomllm.rs` |

## Dependencies

